On Radix, `cp` shares a Btrfs file's data with the copy as it does on
Linux: --reflink=auto, the default, as on Linux, tries Linux's FICLONE
and copies when the filesystem cannot share, and --reflink=always fails
then (ADR 0139). Dukovo only.

